# Git credentials file - one line per host
# Format: https://username:token@hostname
#
# Copy this file to .git-credentials and fill in your credentials.
# Mount at runtime: -v /path/to/.git-credentials:/root/.git-credentials:ro
#
# Examples:
# https://myuser:ghp_xxxxxxxxxxxx@github.com
# https://myuser:glpat-xxxxxxxxxxxx@gitlab.example.com
# https://myuser:mytoken@bitbucket.example.com
